---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="DevApplications — Arcade Indie Studio · Barcelona"
  description="DevApplications es un estudio indie de videojuegos móviles creado por Antonio Ramos en Barcelona. Juegos arcade rejugables para Android, sin muros de pago ni sistemas de energía."
>

  <!-- ── HERO ── -->
  <header id="home" class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-meta reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">
          <span data-i18n="es">Estudio Indie · Barcelona</span>
          <span data-i18n="en">Indie Studio · Barcelona</span>
        </span>
        <span class="eyebrow-num">EST. 2014 · NO. 02 · 2026</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            <span class="line" data-i18n="es">Arcade games</span>
            <span class="line" data-i18n="en">Arcade games</span>
            <span class="line" data-i18n="es">que <span class="ital">no puedes</span></span>
            <span class="line" data-i18n="en">you <span class="ital">can't put</span></span>
            <span class="line" data-i18n="es"><span class="u">soltar.</span></span>
            <span class="line" data-i18n="en"><span class="u">down.</span></span>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-sub" data-i18n="es">
            Creamos <strong>juegos móviles</strong> rápidos, rejugables y sin trampas. Cada partida es diferente,
            cada run tiene su propia historia. <strong>Sin muros de pago.</strong> <strong>Sin sistemas de energía.</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="hero-sub" data-i18n="en">
            We build <strong>fast, replayable mobile games</strong> with no tricks. Every run is different,
            every run tells its own story. <strong>No paywalls.</strong> <strong>No energy systems.</strong>
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#games" class="btn">
              <span data-i18n="es">Ver juegos</span><span data-i18n="en">Our games</span>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#studio" class="btn ghost">
              <span data-i18n="es">Sobre el estudio</span><span data-i18n="en">About the studio</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="scroll-cue">
            <span data-i18n="es">Desplaza para explorar</span>
            <span data-i18n="en">Scroll to explore</span>
            <span class="scroll-arrow">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-card reveal" style="--d:120ms">
          <div class="hero-card-head">
            <span>FEATURED · No. 01</span>
            <span>∘ LIVE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-card-body">
            <img src="/images/logoDevApplications.png" alt="DevApplications logo" loading="eager" />
          </div>
          <dl class="hero-card-foot">
            <div>
              <dt>Founded</dt>
              <dd>2014</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Games</dt>
              <dd>18</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Place</dt>
              <dd>BCN</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ── GAMES ── -->
  <section id="games" class="band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="band-head reveal">
        <div class="band-meta">
          <span>§ <strong>02</strong> / Catálogo</span>
          <span data-i18n="es">Dieciocho títulos · Android</span>
          <span data-i18n="en">Eighteen titles · Android</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="band-title">
          <span data-i18n="es">Nuestros <em>juegos</em>, uno por uno.</span>
          <span data-i18n="en">Our <em>games</em>, one by one.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="games">

        <!-- Tents and Trees: No Coins -->
        <article class="game reveal">
          <div class="game-num">№ 01</div>
          <div class="game-art">
            <div class="game-art-corner">
              <span>ANDROID</span>
              <span data-i18n="es">NUEVO</span>
              <span data-i18n="en">NEW</span>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/tents-and-trees.png" alt="Tents and Trees: No Coins" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="game-body">
            <div class="game-meta">
              <span><b data-i18n="es">Género:</b><b data-i18n="en">Genre:</b> Logic Puzzle</span>
              <span><span class="dot-android"></span> Android</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="game-title">Tents and Trees: No Coins</h3>

            <dl class="game-stats">
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Formato</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Format</dt>
                <dd>Puzzle</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Partida</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Session</dt>
                <dd>2–20′</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Precio</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Price</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Gratis</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Free</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>

            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="es">
              El clásico puzzle lógico de tiendas y árboles, y todos sus tableros gratis. Una tienda
              junto a cada árbol, las tiendas nunca se tocan y los números cuentan las tiendas de
              cada fila y columna. Cinco tamaños de 6×6 a 15×15 y cuatro dificultades abiertos desde
              el primer día, cada puzzle verificado por un solver con una única solución y pistas
              que explican la deducción.
            </p>
            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="en">
              The classic tents and trees logic puzzle, with every single board free. One tent next
              to each tree, tents never touch, and the numbers count the tents in each row and
              column. Five sizes from 6×6 to 15×15 and four difficulties open from day one, every
              puzzle solver-checked to have exactly one solution, and hints that explain the
              deduction.
            </p>

            <div class="game-tags">
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Sin muros de pago</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">No paywalls</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Gratis</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">Free to play</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Lógica</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Logic</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Reto diario</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Daily</span>
              <span class="pill">Offline</span>
            </div>

            <div class="game-cta">
              <a
                href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.devapplications.tentsandtrees"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="btn"
              >
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.523 0H6.477L0 12l6.477 12h11.046L24 12 17.523 0z" /></svg>
                <span data-i18n="es">Jugar en Google Play</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">Play on Google Play</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Killer Sudoku: No Coins -->
        <article class="game reveal">
          <div class="game-num">№ 02</div>
          <div class="game-art">
            <div class="game-art-corner">
              <span>ANDROID</span>
              <span data-i18n="es">NUEVO</span>
              <span data-i18n="en">NEW</span>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/killer-sudoku.png" alt="Killer Sudoku: No Coins" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="game-body">
            <div class="game-meta">
              <span><b data-i18n="es">Género:</b><b data-i18n="en">Genre:</b> Sudoku Logic Puzzle</span>
              <span><span class="dot-android"></span> Android</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="game-title">Killer Sudoku: No Coins</h3>

            <dl class="game-stats">
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Formato</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Format</dt>
                <dd>Sudoku</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Partida</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Session</dt>
                <dd>5–30′</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Precio</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Price</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Gratis</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Free</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>

            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="es">
              Killer sudoku clásico y ni un solo tablero detrás de un muro. 12 tableros con tres
              estilos de jaula y cuatro dificultades, todos abiertos desde el primer día. Un solver
              garantiza solución única en cada tablero, las pistas nombran la regla en vez de
              rellenar la casilla y los anuncios nunca cortan un puzzle a medias.
            </p>
            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="en">
              Classic killer sudoku, and not one board sits behind a wall. 12 boards across three
              cage styles and four difficulties, all open from day one. A solver guarantees a unique
              solution for every board, hints name the rule instead of filling the cell, and ads
              never cut into a puzzle.
            </p>

            <div class="game-tags">
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Sin muros de pago</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">No paywalls</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Gratis</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">Free to play</span>
              <span class="pill">Sudoku</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Lógica</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Logic</span>
              <span class="pill">Offline</span>
            </div>

            <div class="game-cta">
              <a
                href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.devapplications.killersudoku"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="btn"
              >
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.523 0H6.477L0 12l6.477 12h11.046L24 12 17.523 0z" /></svg>
                <span data-i18n="es">Jugar en Google Play</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">Play on Google Play</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Hanoi Tower: Disc Puzzle -->
        <article class="game reveal">
          <div class="game-num">№ 03</div>
          <div class="game-art">
            <div class="game-art-corner">
              <span>ANDROID</span>
              <span>PUZZLE</span>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/hanoi-tower.png" alt="Hanoi Tower: Disc Puzzle" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="game-body">
            <div class="game-meta">
              <span><b data-i18n="es">Género:</b><b data-i18n="en">Genre:</b> Logic Puzzle</span>
              <span><span class="dot-android"></span> Android</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="game-title">Hanoi Tower: Disc Puzzle</h3>

            <dl class="game-stats">
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Formato</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Format</dt>
                <dd>Puzzle</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Partida</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Session</dt>
                <dd>1–10′</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Precio</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Price</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Gratis</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Free</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>

            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="es">
              La Torre de Hanói de siempre y un cuarto poste que la convierte en un puzzle de
              verdad. Cada movimiento se cuenta frente al mínimo demostrado: no puedes perder, solo
              tardar más. 24 niveles elegidos a mano por tener decisiones reales y 60 puzzles de «ni
              un movimiento de más».
            </p>
            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="en">
              The classic Tower of Hanoi, and a fourth peg that turns it into a real puzzle. Every
              move is counted against the proven minimum: you can't lose, you can only take longer.
              24 hand-picked levels kept only if they hold real decisions, and 60 'not one wasted
              move' puzzles.
            </p>

            <div class="game-tags">
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Sin muros de pago</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">No paywalls</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Gratis</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">Free to play</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Lógica</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Logic</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Ingenio</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Brain</span>
              <span class="pill">Offline</span>
            </div>

            <div class="game-cta">
              <a
                href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.devapplications.hanoi"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="btn"
              >
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.523 0H6.477L0 12l6.477 12h11.046L24 12 17.523 0z" /></svg>
                <span data-i18n="es">Jugar en Google Play</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">Play on Google Play</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Shut the Box Classic -->
        <article class="game reveal">
          <div class="game-num">№ 04</div>
          <div class="game-art">
            <div class="game-art-corner">
              <span>ANDROID</span>
              <span data-i18n="es">DADOS</span>
              <span data-i18n="en">DICE</span>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/shut-the-box.png" alt="Shut the Box Classic" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="game-body">
            <div class="game-meta">
              <span><b data-i18n="es">Género:</b><b data-i18n="en">Genre:</b> Dice Board Game</span>
              <span><span class="dot-android"></span> Android</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="game-title">Shut the Box Classic</h3>

            <dl class="game-stats">
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Formato</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Format</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Dados</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Dice</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Partida</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Session</dt>
                <dd>2′</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Precio</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Price</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Gratis</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Free</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>

            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="es">
              El viejo juego de dados de taberna, en el móvil. Tira dos dados, cierra las fichas que
              sumen la tirada e intenta cerrar la caja entera. Caja clásica de 9 fichas y la larga
              de 12, 2 jugadores en un mismo móvil, seis niveles de IA medidos contra la jugada
              óptima y reto diario con un único intento.
            </p>
            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="en">
              The old pub dice game, on your phone. Roll two dice, shut the tiles that add up to the
              roll and try to shut the whole box. Classic 9-tile box and the long 12-tile one, 2
              players on one phone, six AI levels measured against the optimal move and a
              one-attempt daily challenge.
            </p>

            <div class="game-tags">
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Sin muros de pago</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">No paywalls</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Gratis</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">Free to play</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Dados</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Dice</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">2 jugadores</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">2 Players</span>
              <span class="pill">Offline</span>
            </div>

            <div class="game-cta">
              <a
                href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.devapplications.shutthebox"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="btn"
              >
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.523 0H6.477L0 12l6.477 12h11.046L24 12 17.523 0z" /></svg>
                <span data-i18n="es">Jugar en Google Play</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">Play on Google Play</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Bagh Chal - Tigers & Goats -->
        <article class="game reveal">
          <div class="game-num">№ 05</div>
          <div class="game-art">
            <div class="game-art-corner">
              <span>ANDROID</span>
              <span data-i18n="es">TABLERO</span>
              <span data-i18n="en">BOARD</span>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/bagh-chal.png" alt="Bagh Chal - Tigers &amp; Goats" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="game-body">
            <div class="game-meta">
              <span><b data-i18n="es">Género:</b><b data-i18n="en">Genre:</b> Strategy Board Game</span>
              <span><span class="dot-android"></span> Android</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="game-title">Bagh Chal - Tigers &amp; Goats</h3>

            <dl class="game-stats">
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Formato</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Format</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Tablero</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Board</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Partida</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Session</dt>
                <dd>5–15′</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Precio</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Price</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Gratis</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Free</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>

            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="es">
              El juego de mesa nacional de Nepal: cuatro tigres contra veinte cabras en el tablero
              de Alquerque. Los tigres cazan saltando, las cabras ganan bloqueando: dos bandos, dos
              juegos distintos. Seis niveles de IA con un cerebro diferente para cada bando, 2
              jugadores en un mismo móvil y reto diario.
            </p>
            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="en">
              Nepal's national board game: four tigers against twenty goats on the old Alquerque
              board. Tigers hunt by jumping, goats win by blocking: two sides, two completely
              different games. Six AI levels with a separate brain for each side, 2 players on one
              phone and a daily challenge.
            </p>

            <div class="game-tags">
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Sin muros de pago</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">No paywalls</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Gratis</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">Free to play</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Estrategia</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Strategy</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">2 jugadores</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">2 Players</span>
              <span class="pill">Offline</span>
            </div>

            <div class="game-cta">
              <a
                href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.devapplications.baghchal"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="btn"
              >
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.523 0H6.477L0 12l6.477 12h11.046L24 12 17.523 0z" /></svg>
                <span data-i18n="es">Jugar en Google Play</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">Play on Google Play</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Vexillology: Flag Color Quiz -->
        <article class="game reveal">
          <div class="game-num">№ 06</div>
          <div class="game-art">
            <div class="game-art-corner">
              <span>ANDROID</span>
              <span>TRIVIA</span>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/vexillology.png" alt="Vexillology: Flag Color Quiz" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="game-body">
            <div class="game-meta">
              <span><b data-i18n="es">Género:</b><b data-i18n="en">Genre:</b> Flag Quiz Trivia</span>
              <span><span class="dot-android"></span> Android</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="game-title">Vexillology: Flag Color Quiz</h3>

            <dl class="game-stats">
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Formato</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Format</dt>
                <dd>Quiz</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Partida</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Session</dt>
                <dd>1–10′</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt data-i18n="es">Precio</dt>
                <dt data-i18n="en">Price</dt>
                <dd data-i18n="es">Gratis</dd>
                <dd data-i18n="en">Free</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>

            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="es">
              Un quiz de banderas para quien ya se las sabe: la bandera nunca se muestra, se
              destila. Ves sus colores con el porcentaje de área de cada uno, un recorte, una frase
              que la describe o tres falsificaciones junto a la real. 6 modos y 2.715 preguntas
              sobre las 195 banderas, con grupos de banderas casi idénticas calculados por distancia
              de color.
            </p>
            <p class="game-desc" data-i18n="en">
              A flag quiz for people who already know the flags: the flag is never shown, it's
              distilled. You get its colours by share of area, a cropped piece, a sentence
              describing it, or three fakes next to the real one. 6 modes and 2,715 questions across
              all 195 flags, with near-identical groups computed from colour distance.
            </p>

            <div class="game-tags">
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Sin muros de pago</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">No paywalls</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="es">Gratis</span>
              <span class="pill accent" data-i18n="en">Free to play</span>
              <span class="pill">Trivia</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="es">Geografía</span>
              <span class="pill" data-i18n="en">Geography</span>
